  "note": "Triennial election of the Ballyclare Urban Council, poll due 17 May 1961. Ten nominations were received for nine seats; Samuel E. Allen then withdrew, so no poll was taken (Larne Times, 4 May 1961, p. 9; notice of no poll, Larne Times, 11 May 1961, p. 3). S. E. Allen withdrew, leaving nine candidates for nine seats; no poll. Returned unopposed."
